_V0 Notes:

_V0 #1a: Both version can interfere if boss use instant kill
#DETAILS: For example, the Rabbit (Path 2) boss in the Lost Wood level have the bone break skill. If the boss use the skill while the cheat is activated your character will glitch and you won't be able to move.

_V0 #1b: Use v2 if you're playing on Ultimate difficulty!
#DETAILS: Enemies at this difficulty can easily overwhelm your max HP. If you die while the `Infinite HP v1` cheat is activated your character will glitch and you wouldn't be able to move it.

_V0 #2: Cheat(s) must be activated in town
#DETAILS: Enter a different map then exit to reflect change

_V0 #3: Doesn't apply to disposable weapons

_V0 #4: Skills you have acquired last is removed if quit the game
#DETAILS: You'll lost all the skills you have acquired last if you quit the game. Use the `Have All Skills` cheat instead.

_V0 #5: This unlocks max level cap as well
#DETAILS: (obviously) but you wouldn't be able to change difficulty unless you've finished the game

